    "El Coach está apagado por mantenimiento. Tu plan sigue funcionando normal.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The Coach is down for maintenance. Your plan keeps working as usual."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "El Coach explica y propone; tu plan lo decide el motor de Maratonia y lo confirmás vos. Nada cambia sin tu OK.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The Coach explains and proposes; your plan is decided by Maratonia's engine and confirmed by you. Nothing changes without your OK."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "El Coach necesita sesión iniciada.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The Coach needs you to be signed in."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "El Coach no propone cambios: tu plan sigue según lo previsto.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The Coach proposes no changes — your plan is on track."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "El Coach no pudo responder. Tu plan no depende de él: seguí entrenando.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The Coach couldn't answer. Your plan doesn't depend on it: keep training."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "El Coach no puede aumentar la carga: eso lo decide el motor.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The Coach can't increase your load — the engine decides that."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "El contenido de %@ todavía no está listo — no vamos a inventarlo. Tu perfil queda guardado; mientras tanto podés usar los planes de 5K y 10K.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The content for %@ isn't ready yet — we won't make it up. Your profile is saved; meanwhile you can use the 5K and 10K plans."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "El equilibrio clásico": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The classic balance"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "El horizonte es solo para esta vista previa.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
