            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The horizon only affects this preview."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "El motor rechazó todos los cambios propuestos — no se aplica nada.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The engine rejected every proposed change — nothing is applied."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "El nombre que ves en el reloj al mandar el plan.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The name you see on the watch when sending the plan."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "El plan de este teléfono se reemplaza por el último respaldo de iCloud. No se puede deshacer.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This phone's plan is replaced by the latest iCloud backup. This cannot be undone."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "El plan no se está respaldando: no hay sesión de iCloud activa.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Your plan isn't being backed up: no active iCloud session."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "El plan se archiva — no se borra nada: tus carreras, historial y tramos personalizados quedan intactos. La app pasa a modo libre y podés adoptar otro plan cuando quieras.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The plan is archived — nothing is deleted: your runs, history and custom intervals stay intact. The app switches to free mode and you can adopt another plan whenever you want."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "El plan se arma alrededor de esto.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Your plan is built around this."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "El registro con email estará disponible muy pronto.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
